  "description": "“Basement extension with the installation of skylights to front garden”",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposed development would result in the provision of substandard and poor form of living conditions for future occupiers in terms lack of daylight, sunlight and outlook, to the detriment of the long term health and well being of future occupiers of the development, contrary to London Plan (2021) Policy D6, LP2 and LP17 of the Hackney Local Plan LP33 (2020).&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;docs-internal-guid-65f538ba-7fff-5e74-5718-4b89db9ebbda&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;By reason of the basement exceeding the depth of the front garden by 50 per cent; its construction exacerbated by the provision of three large roof lights within the front curtilage, the proposed development would have an unacceptable impact on the character and appearance of the site and wider streetscene contrary to policies D1, D3 and D4 of the London Plan (2021), and policy LP1  of the Hackney Local Plan (2020), and the guidance as contained within the Council’s &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-style: italic; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;Residential Extensions and Alterations SPD.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
